  "How long so far, how long is left, or no clock at all. The warnings and the point's own timing are on the pulpit's settings sheet, on s.": "Sudah berapa lama, berapa lama lagi, atau tanpa jam sama sekali. Peringatan dan waktu tiap poin ada di lembar pengaturan mimbar, pada s.",
