  "Every sermon is a plain file in here. Change… switches to another folder as it is, moving nothing; to take the sermons along, connect or disconnect below.": "Kila mahubiri ni faili ya kawaida humu. Badilisha… huhamia folda nyingine kama ilivyo, bila kuhamisha chochote; kuchukua mahubiri pamoja nawe, unganisha au tenganisha hapa chini.",
  "Every sermon tagged “{from}” is tagged “{to}” instead": "Kila mahubiri yenye lebo “{from}” yanapewa lebo “{to}” badala yake",
  "Every sermon tagged “{name}” is marked for {name} in its byline instead, and the tag comes off. A sermon already for another occasion keeps the tag.": "Kila mahubiri yenye lebo “{name}” yanawekwa alama ya {name} katika mstari wa taarifa zake badala yake, na lebo huondolewa. Mahubiri yaliyo tayari ya tukio jingine hubaki na lebo.",
  "Every word, in large type. The paragraph you are on is lit, the rest dimmed, and nothing leaves the screen mid-sentence.": "Kila neno, kwa herufi kubwa. Aya uliyopo huangazwa, nyingine hufifishwa, na hakuna kinachotoka skrini katikati ya sentensi.",
