  "Nothing in this series yet. Plan the next below, or set a sermon's series in its header.": "Hakuna kitu katika mfululizo huu bado. Panga yanayofuata hapa chini, au weka mfululizo wa mahubiri katika sehemu yake ya juu.",
  "Nothing in this sermon appears in the outline.": "Hakuna kitu katika mahubiri haya kinachoonekana katika muhtasari.",
  "Nothing in this sermon is marked to show on the podium screen.": "Hakuna kitu katika mahubiri haya kilichotiwa alama kuonyeshwa kwenye skrini ya mimbari.",
  "Nothing is bold yet, so this sheet has no blanks. Make bold the words to leave out, in a key line or wherever the sheet prints, and each becomes a gap.": "Hakuna herufi nzito bado, hivyo karatasi hii haina nafasi wazi. Fanya nzito maneno ya kuacha, katika sentensi muhimu au popote karatasi inapochapisha, na kila moja huwa pengo.",
  "Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is written for you.": "Hakuna kinachopakiwa, na hakuna kinachoandikwa kwa niaba yako.",
  "Nothing is written until you choose. Marking it preached sets the date and keeps today’s version in History; a rehearsal keeps today’s minutes as the plan and nothing else; closing keeps nothing.": "Hakuna kinachoandikwa mpaka uchague. Kutia alama imehubiriwa huweka tarehe na kuhifadhi toleo la leo katika Historia; mazoezi huhifadhi dakika za leo kama mpango na si kingine; kufunga hakuhifadhi kitu.",
  "Nothing kept yet. The folder keeps each day’s version from the first change made on the day after it.": "Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa bado. Folda huhifadhi toleo la kila siku kuanzia badiliko la kwanza lililofanywa siku inayofuata.",
