  "This sermon has blocks of a kind this version does not know ({kinds}), shown as plain text. It opens read-only, so the file keeps them as they were; a newer SermonDesk can edit it.": "Mahubiri haya yana vipande vya aina ambazo toleo hili halijui ({kinds}), vinaonyeshwa kama maandishi tupu. Yanafunguka kwa kusoma tu, kwa hivyo faili inavihifadhi kama vilivyokuwa; SermonDesk mpya zaidi inaweza kuvihariri.",
