  "This sermon was written by a newer version of SermonDesk (file version {version}). It opens read-only here, so nothing that version wrote is lost; update to edit it.": "Mahubiri haya yaliandikwa na toleo jipya zaidi la SermonDesk (toleo la faili {version}). Yanafunguka kwa kusoma tu hapa, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichoandikwa na toleo hilo kinachopotea; sasisha ili kuyahariri.",
